  "workspace": {
    "id": "80af0f97-b557-443d-852e-391307f47427",
    "bindings": [
      {
        "id": "3361363c-c80f-4252-9b61-cc628825208b",
        "text": "怪不得我今年财运这么差！原来是少了补财运的东西，",
        "itemId": "shot-S01-full",
        "shotId": "S01",
        "source": {
          "kind": "video",
          "sha256": "54254cbbc3c770ec259bdc18dce1570bd65e13dd98446accfe449ca61a6fd3b1",
          "fileSize": 3611909,
          "relativePath": "episodes/bbea3b57-061b-4341-9ba1-3bf65d28899f/materials/54254cbbc3c770ec259bdc18dce1570bd65e13dd98446accfe449ca61a6fd3b1-prepared-S01.mp4",
          "materialRevisionId": "e0c25c48-b261-4353-af28-73e9a617d561"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "1eeba7bd-1549-4d76-87f2-2cc02ed2f5ae",
        "text": "自从朋友推荐我请了这副日照金山后，店铺里生意好了不少，",
        "itemId": "shot-S02-full",
        "shotId": "S02",
        "source": {
          "kind": "video",
          "sha256": "1cf029cc7348537bff46a35925637410e121e3dd96249b94d3d549e3e1712120",
          "fileSize": 2505843,
          "relativePath": "episodes/bbea3b57-061b-4341-9ba1-3bf65d28899f/materials/1cf029cc7348537bff46a35925637410e121e3dd96249b94d3d549e3e1712120-prepared-S02.mp4",
          "materialRevisionId": "70c2d544-3295-4bef-a301-10c65698db70"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "5dac67be-bf3a-4071-ad15-34632e138947",
        "text": "天天出去打牌，手气也感觉比以前顺了！",
        "itemId": "shot-S03-full",
        "shotId": "S03",
        "source": {
          "kind": "video",
          "sha256": "de688d12bec3a104074599874fcec84d2cfe30e064e645fbb4004f20ebef405b",
          "fileSize": 1838317,
          "relativePath": "episodes/bbea3b57-061b-4341-9ba1-3bf65d28899f/materials/de688d12bec3a104074599874fcec84d2cfe30e064e645fbb4004f20ebef405b-prepared-S03.mp4",
          "materialRevisionId": "ffec0142-a77e-41c3-9d04-13eb7d7f239f"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "b038cd8c-490d-449a-a80a-312486fcc05c",
        "text": "就连老婆也突然升职加薪了，",
        "itemId": "shot-S04-full",
        "shotId": "S04",
        "source": {
          "kind": "video",
          "sha256": "b2a08eeeeefdd00ce76d0bf2e89a94d919a75305f9213c2d3afe441f51f3fe2f",
          "fileSize": 1009725,
          "relativePath": "episodes/bbea3b57-061b-4341-9ba1-3bf65d28899f/materials/b2a08eeeeefdd00ce76d0bf2e89a94d919a75305f9213c2d3afe441f51f3fe2f-prepared-S04.mp4",
          "materialRevisionId": "489477b7-7cec-4a0d-b694-6569cefca13e"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "9cf30365-25d2-4cfb-8955-1a72f131e9b1",
        "text": "后来朋友告诉我，这幅日照象征金山旭日东升、前程光明、事业兴旺！",
        "itemId": "shot-S05-full",
        "shotId": "S05",
        "source": {
          "kind": "video",
          "sha256": "9e1035475a79576b965e94dd3654bc29772e421e6400f14ff924ca9ab7f69727",
          "fileSize": 2118925,
          "relativePath": "episodes/bbea3b57-061b-4341-9ba1-3bf65d28899f/materials/9e1035475a79576b965e94dd3654bc29772e421e6400f14ff924ca9ab7f69727-prepared-S05.mp4",
          "materialRevisionId": "314acd3c-eb38-4425-b185-4058c891846d"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "d340bece-28a6-47f3-b060-9ed48f6146dc",
        "text": "挂在家里的客厅或者店铺里，",
        "itemId": "shot-S06-full",
        "shotId": "S06",
        "source": {
          "kind": "video",
          "sha256": "8b1e1d1c8507f24f147f3f7e0f64c2a560c3bc5e88d859256130dd8bdc7abd31",
          "fileSize": 2294459,
          "relativePath": "episodes/bbea3b57-061b-4341-9ba1-3bf65d28899f/materials/8b1e1d1c8507f24f147f3f7e0f64c2a560c3bc5e88d859256130dd8bdc7abd31-prepared-S06.mp4",
          "materialRevisionId": "94194dcb-5c06-4acf-b0eb-9f08b7ea9722"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "f3173ced-108f-474c-85a3-70293c8f753e",
        "text": "背靠金山，流水生金，寓意招财纳福、财源广进！",
        "itemId": "shot-S07-full",
        "shotId": "S07",
        "source": {
          "kind": "video",
          "sha256": "e193d228e7b75e43b07b3a0a1dd8b48b944a50c6023cff7838008355be962de2",
          "fileSize": 1572425,
          "relativePath": "episodes/bbea3b57-061b-4341-9ba1-3bf65d28899f/materials/e193d228e7b75e43b07b3a0a1dd8b48b944a50c6023cff7838008355be962de2-prepared-S07.mp4",
          "materialRevisionId": "80de95d7-66f2-4cf7-be8b-8865b7589789"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "bf5eb575-6869-46d2-a631-93924128848a",
        "text": "如果你最近生意平平，做事总觉得差一点机会，",
        "itemId": "shot-S08-full",
        "shotId": "S08",
        "source": {
          "kind": "video",
          "sha256": "f86f03a8ab06b9680e0096a57ac4f48516e4d23e17c6e170cb8fc01864b8b301",
          "fileSize": 2923722,
          "relativePath": "episodes/bbea3b57-061b-4341-9ba1-3bf65d28899f/materials/f86f03a8ab06b9680e0096a57ac4f48516e4d23e17c6e170cb8fc01864b8b301-prepared-S08.mp4",
          "materialRevisionId": "08e666e8-5eea-4229-8ffa-771d4a1ef5d5"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "8ee7ac9c-b63e-4643-b6a2-17a514f0f914",
        "text": "不妨给家里或者店铺添上一幅日照金山，讨个好彩头！",
        "itemId": "shot-S09-full",
        "shotId": "S09",
        "source": {
          "kind": "video",
          "sha256": "abba64dfe88ea6714061b809485ea17cc12b68aa780ee807951344636ae4fe16",
          "fileSize": 2573051,
          "relativePath": "episodes/bbea3b57-061b-4341-9ba1-3bf65d28899f/materials/abba64dfe88ea6714061b809485ea17cc12b68aa780ee807951344636ae4fe16-prepared-S09.mp4",
          "materialRevisionId": "66b8d1c7-95e5-4c66-bce2-7bd2e7a8b7c1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "5d66cc10-0173-4285-9f24-4a6ed982c2a3",
        "text": "点击视频左下角链接，把这幅日照金山请回家！",
        "itemId": "shot-S10-full",
        "shotId": "S10",
        "source": {
